<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said it has launched 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hang Seng Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants</p>
<p>control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$90	  PREMIUM	 15.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.603     GEARING	 13.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  01.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 14.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$83.25</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
